 ### SurfaceExtractorCubes
-Cube-based surface extraction using a vertex-edge table (VETable) and ear-clipping. It resolves the four-cut face ambiguity by evaluating the sign of the determinant $f_{00}f_{11} - f_{01}f_{10}$, adding a branch point when $\det == 0$ [S1, unofficial]. Unlike the tetrahedra extractor which solves $V - L = 0$, the cubes extractor solves $2V - (2L+1) = 0$ [S1, unofficial]. To extract the same surface, voxels must be doubled and the level set to $2L+1$ [S1, unofficial].
