 ## Operating characteristics
-*   **Complexity:** Linear in the number of voxels, $O(N)$, where $N$ is the number of voxels. Each voxel is processed independently [S1, unofficial].
-*   **Memory:** Proportional to the number of surface triangles and vertices. The use of maps for canonical strings adds overhead compared to direct array indexing but ensures deterministic ordering [S1, unofficial].
-*   **Performance:** The method is robust and handles degenerate cases (zero-valued vertices) explicitly [S1, unofficial]. The `int64_t` arithmetic ensures precision but may be slower than floating-point operations if not optimized [S1, unofficial]. The bug fix in the odd-parity branch is critical for correct orientation [S1, unofficial].
